Third-party data
----------------
This licence covers the code and the analysis outputs in this repository,
except for third-party dataset content included in the results database and
in paper/generated/question_manifest.csv, which remains under its own licence:

- HotpotQA (Yang et al., EMNLP 2018), distributed by its authors under
  CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
- FinanceBench (Islam et al., arXiv:2311.11944), public sample from HuggingFace
  PatronusAI/financebench, distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/). Non-commercial use only.

Changes: questions were inserted into prompt templates, and FinanceBench
evidence was truncated to 2,000 characters with a truncation marker. No other
changes were made to the dataset content.
